            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "weta_src_09",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Sources: WETA REEF \u00b7 Mission Bay \u00b7 Treasure Island \u00b7 Redwood City project pages \u00b7 Navier Alameda materials"
          }
        },
        {
          "replaceImage": {
            "imageObjectId": "p12_i2",
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jaideepdhanoa/navier-atlas/c2359e196ed5d569006c4a8383973b23f6f257cd/deck-studio/assets/weta/genai/weta-n30-mission-bay-v2.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p13_i3",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p13_i3",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "FIRST \u00b7 A BAY DEMONSTRATION FROM ALAMEDA\n\nBefore choosing a public route, put the N30 through a WETA-shaped Bay test.\n\n\u2022 Safety case and operating envelope\n\u2022 Energy use, charging and range reserve\n\u2022 Reliability, maintenance and crew workflow\n\u2022 Ride quality, wake and noise\n\u2022 Terminal interface and emergency procedures\n\nOUTPUT \u00b7 A shared evidence pack\u2014not a route or procurement commitment."
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "weta_src_10",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "weta_src_10",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Sources: WETA pilot framework \u00b7 Navier Alameda and N30 materials"
          }
        },
        {
          "replaceImage": {
            "imageObjectId": "p13_i2",
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jaideepdhanoa/navier-atlas/c2359e196ed5d569006c4a8383973b23f6f257cd/deck-studio/assets/weta/genai/weta-n30-alameda-hero-v2.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "act_3_gates_partnership_close",
      "requests": [
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p18_i3",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p18_i3",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "THEN \u00b7 A WETA-SELECTED SERVICE PILOT"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p18_i5",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p18_i5",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "ONE USE CASE\nAfter certification, accessibility, terminal, charging, labor and procurement requirements are satisfied, pilot one WETA-selected use case with normal public-transit standards."
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p18_i7",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p18_i7",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "MEASURE WHAT MATTERS\nEnergy and cost per trip \u00b7 availability \u00b7 on-time performance \u00b7 maintenance \u00b7 rider experience \u00b7 accessibility \u00b7 operator and community feedback."
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p18_i9",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p18_i9",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "MAKE THE DECISION BEFORE SCALING\nAgree success and stop thresholds before launch. WETA decides whether to continue, modify or stop."
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "weta_src_11",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "weta_src_11",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Sources: WETA 2050 pilot framework \u00b7 SF Bay Ferry public-service standards"
          }
        },
        {
          "replaceImage": {
            "imageObjectId": "p18_i2",
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jaideepdhanoa/navier-atlas/c2359e196ed5d569006c4a8383973b23f6f257cd/deck-studio/assets/weta/genai/weta-n30-mission-bay-v2.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p19_i3",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p19_i3",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "WHEN THE DATA SUPPORTS IT\nBuild a new electric service layer\n\n1 \u00b7 Add frequency or vessels on a successful pilot.\n2 \u00b7 Extend to another WETA-selected market.\n3 \u00b7 Introduce larger-capacity foiling vessels when ready.\n4 \u00b7 Add autonomy only after safety, certification and operating proof.\n\nEach step follows WETA approval, procurement, terminal, labor and community processes."
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p19_i4",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p19_i4",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Partner proposal \u00b7 Passenger service first \u00b7 Subject to WETA and regulatory review"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "weta_src_12",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "weta_src_12",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Sources: WETA 2050 Service Vision \u00b7 Navier platform and autonomy materials"
          }
        },
        {
          "replaceImage": {
            "imageObjectId": "p19_i2",
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jaideepdhanoa/navier-atlas/c2359e196ed5d569006c4a8383973b23f6f257cd/deck-studio/assets/weta/genai/weta-n30-redwood-city-v2.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p20_i3",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p20_i3",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "SIX GATES. NO SHORTCUTS.\n\nSAFETY + CERTIFICATION \u00b7 USCG pathway, operating envelope, redundancy and emergency procedures.\n\nACCESSIBLE PUBLIC SERVICE \u00b7 Boarding, seating, mobility devices, bikes, luggage and fare integration.\n\nTERMINAL + CHARGING \u00b7 Berth access, shore power, turnaround, utilities and resilience.\n\nBAY OPERATING FIT \u00b7 Weather, sea state, range reserve, wake, noise and navigation.\n\nCREW + MAINTENANCE \u00b7 Training, staffing, spares, diagnostics, dispatch and local support.\n\nECONOMICS + PUBLIC VALUE \u00b7 Lifecycle cost, reliability, useful access, equity and rider outcomes."
          }
        },
        {
          "updateTextStyle": {
            "objectId": "p20_i3",
            "style": {
              "fontFamily": "Poppins",
              "fontSize": {
                "magnitude": 11.8,
                "unit": "PT"
              }
            },
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            },
            "fields": "fontFamily,fontSize"
          }
        },
        {
          "updateParagraphStyle": {
            "objectId": "p20_i3",
            "style": {
              "lineSpacing": 100
            },
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            },
            "fields": "lineSpacing"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "weta_src_13",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "weta_src_13",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Sources: WETA 2050 Service Vision \u00b7 SF Bay Ferry standards \u00b7 Navier N30 platform"
          }
        },
        {
          "replaceImage": {
            "imageObjectId": "p20_i2",
            "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jaideepdhanoa/navier-atlas/c2359e196ed5d569006c4a8383973b23f6f257cd/deck-studio/assets/weta/genai/weta-n30-foil-efficiency-v2.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p21_i2",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p21_i2",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "HOW THE PARTNERSHIP WORKS"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p21_eqb",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p21_eqb",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "WETA sets the public standard. Navier earns the right to scale."
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p21_h1",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p21_h1",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "WETA"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p21_h2",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p21_h2",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "NAVIER"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p21_h3",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p21_h3",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "TOGETHER"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p21_c1l",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p21_c1l",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Choose the public problem\nSet passenger, equity and safety standards\nDefine network and fare integration\nSelect the legal and procurement path"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p21_c2l",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p21_c2l",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Supply vessel and engineering evidence\nProvide local operating and maintenance support\nDesign the data and pilot plan\nBe transparent about limits and risk"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p21_c3l",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p21_c3l",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Select one use case\nDesign terminal and charging interfaces\nAgree success and stop thresholds\nDecide whether to expand, modify or stop"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p21_ft",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p21_ft",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "WETA retains network, safety, procurement and public-service authority throughout."
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "weta_src_14",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "weta_src_14",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Source: WETA 2050 Service Vision and pilot framework"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p22_i2",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p22_i2",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "NEXT STEP \u00b7 CHOOSE ONE BAY PROBLEM"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p22_eqb",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p22_eqb",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Design the test together."
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p22_h1",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p22_h1",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "SELECT"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p22_h2",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p22_h2",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "DESIGN"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p22_h3",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p22_h3",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "DECIDE"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p22_c1l",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p22_c1l",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Choose one candidate use case\nDefine the rider need\nSet the public-service standard"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p22_c2l",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p22_c2l",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Build a decision-ready demonstration and pilot plan\nResolve vessel, terminal, charging and operating gates"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p22_c3l",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p22_c3l",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Agree data and stop/go thresholds before launch\nExpand only when Bay evidence supports it"
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "p22_ft",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "p22_ft",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Navier is ready to do the work from Alameda."
          }
        },
        {
          "deleteText": {
            "objectId": "weta_src_15",
            "textRange": {
              "type": "ALL"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insertText": {
            "objectId": "weta_src_15",
            "insertionIndex": 0,
            "text": "Sources: WETA 2050 Service Vision \u00b7 Navier company materials"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
